  <name>ActOne Screenplay</name>
  <summary>Write, organize, and export Fountain screenplays</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      ActOne Screenplay is a desktop writing workspace for screenwriters. Write with Fountain formatting, navigate scenes in the outline, and keep multiple scripts and notes together in portable projects.
    </p>
    <p>
      Review your story with X-Ray analytics, recover earlier drafts with local snapshots, and export to PDF, Final Draft, Fade In, or Fountain. Customize the editor with themes.
    </p>
    <p>Muse is an optional AI writing assistant that connects to local Ollama models or an OpenAI-compatible service of your choice.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">ink.iyal.actone.desktop</launchable>
